(7759026, 1284501, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a lovely image.  It speaks in many tongues.  Delicate and exciting.  Love the speckled and winding tonalities.  Did you ever find out where that mongoose was headed?<br/>Big, well-deserved blue.  Congratulations.</td>', 'What a lovely image.  It speaks in many tongues.  Delicate and exciting.  Love the speckled and winding tonalities.  Did you ever find out where that mongoose was headed?Big, well-deserved blue.  Congratulations.', '2023-10-18 18:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759030, 1284501, 100393, '<td valign="top">Blimey.</td>', 'Blimey.', '2023-10-19 04:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759031, 1284501, 70661, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue! This made me look at it for many minutes and ask questions.</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue! This made me look at it for many minutes and ask questions.', '2023-10-19 07:53:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759034, 1284482, 50864, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful and my first comment didnt do it justice. The use of the strong contrast especially in the water where there are  deep blue shadows next to the sunnier  areas is just stunning. When I see water lilies I always feel like I am looking at something a little magical or special but I have never seen a photograph of waterlilies that has the same feeling until now. You have captured the specialness of water lilies with your camera. And, although I have been talking about the waterlilies I think it is the little red fruits in the dappled light that are the real star of the show. If I had gone back through this challenge before rollover I would have bumped to a 10.</td>', 'This is really beautiful and my first comment didnt do it justice. The use of the strong contrast especially in the water where there are  deep blue shadows next to the sunnier  areas is just stunning. When I see water lilies I always feel like I am looking at something a little magical or special but I have never seen a photograph of waterlilies that has the same feeling until now. You have captured the specialness of water lilies with your camera. And, although I have been talking about the waterlilies I think it is the little red fruits in the dappled light that are the real star of the show. If I had gone back through this challenge before rollover I would have bumped to a 10.', '2023-10-19 10:31:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7759040, 1284469, 2333, '<td valign="top">I loved your choice of framing and your processing on this Barry, glad to see that it placed highly!</td>', 'I loved your choice of framing and your processing on this Barry, glad to see that it placed highly!', '2023-10-19 13:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
